---
import { ArrowLeft, ArrowUpRight, Braces, Calculator, Sparkles, Wrench } from 'lucide-astro';
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="在线工具 · Bai / 白" description="Bai 的在线工具：轻量、本地优先、打开即用。">
  <main class="tools-page section-wrap">
    <a class="back-link" href="/"><ArrowLeft /> 返回首页</a>
    <header class="tools-page-header"><div><p class="eyebrow">03 / ONLINE TOOLS</p><h1>在线工具</h1><p>从 baizixv.com 的工具思路出发，把常用的小功能重新实现为本站的本地工具。</p></div><div class="tools-page-mark"><Wrench /></div></header>
    <div class="tools-directory more-tools-directory">
      <a class="tools-directory-card tiny-directory-card" href="/tools/tiny-tools/"><span class="tools-directory-icon"><Braces /></span><span class="eyebrow">MORE TOOLS</span><h2>更多工具</h2><p>时间戳、Base64、MD5、颜色值、随机颜色、二维码和 JSON 格式化，都收在同一个本地工具箱里。</p><span class="tools-directory-link">打开工具集合 <ArrowUpRight /></span></a>
      <a class="tools-directory-card finance-directory-card" href="/tools/finance/"><span class="tools-directory-icon"><Calculator /></span><span class="eyebrow">FINANCE</span><h2>财务计算</h2><p>借贷月供计算与投资回报测算。输入参数后立即得到透明的估算结果。</p><span class="tools-directory-link">开始计算 <ArrowUpRight /></span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="tools-page-foot"><Sparkles /><p>所有当前工具都在浏览器本地运行，输入内容不会上传或保存。</p></div>
  </main>
</Layout>
